  "rationale": "Lowers the accepted rule values that generated code must read into typed constants of one deterministic provider module, because the Factory data/code seam (SPEC_STANDARD 15.9) gives a generator an access signature and never a value. The design home of every value stays its rules address in 60_data_closure.json with its decision trace; lowered_from names that address for each constant and the value here must equal the value there. A consumer that needs one exact entry receives a scalar constant, not a tuple index or a mapping key.",
